(7539879, 1206183, 193704, '<td valign="top">A beautiful bull moose</td>', 'A beautiful bull moose', '2017-10-19 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539888, 1206707, 173844, '<td valign="top">An enchanting scene revealed in the flip.  I want to praise it as a watercolor painting, but that''s essentially what it is.  All its elements are very engaging, of course including the rocks, or ufos, floating across the sky.  I''d kind of like to retreat into this world, at least on occasion.</td>', 'An enchanting scene revealed in the flip.  I want to praise it as a watercolor painting, but that''s essentially what it is.  All its elements are very engaging, of course including the rocks, or ufos, floating across the sky.  I''d kind of like to retreat into this world, at least on occasion.', '2017-10-19 18:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539889, 1206686, 179769, '<td valign="top">I really super-love this...just not sure why!</td>', 'I really super-love this...just not sure why!', '2017-10-19 19:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539890, 1206693, 179769, '<td valign="top">Really good catch.  Neat!</td>', 'Really good catch.  Neat!', '2017-10-19 19:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539891, 1206285, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like opening night at the most opulent opera house in the world.  "Beware Fossegrimmen", the tragic story of a boy, his T. Rex and the overzealous constabulary.<br/>I don''t mean to mock the name, it''s just a flight of fancy.<br/>Amazing what a waterfall can look like upside down.  The power is turned to delicacy, to a display of incredible northern lights.  The somewhat electric blue is even a bit intimidating.  I''m not finally sure what to make of it, but it''s impressive and I like it.</td>', 'Wow, looks like opening night at the most opulent opera house in the world.  "Beware Fossegrimmen", the tragic story of a boy, his T. Rex and the overzealous constabulary.I don''t mean to mock the name, it''s just a flight of fancy.Amazing what a waterfall can look like upside down.  The power is turned to delicacy, to a display of incredible northern lights.  The somewhat electric blue is even a bit intimidating.  I''m not finally sure what to make of it, but it''s impressive and I like it.', '2017-10-19 19:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539911, 1206693, 97225, '<td valign="top">Love this one! Top 3.</td>', 'Love this one! Top 3.', '2017-10-19 19:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539913, 1206285, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2017-10-19 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539915, 1206682, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Top 3.</td>', 'Wonderful! Top 3.', '2017-10-19 19:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539916, 1206527, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2017-10-19 19:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539919, 1206703, 97225, '<td valign="top">Well done! In my top 3.</td>', 'Well done! In my top 3.', '2017-10-19 19:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539921, 1206258, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love this but I think it is rotated rather than flipped.</td>', 'I love this but I think it is rotated rather than flipped.', '2017-10-19 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539924, 1206707, 97225, '<td valign="top">The eve of the flying saucers. Beautiful entry.</td>', 'The eve of the flying saucers. Beautiful entry.', '2017-10-19 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539940, 1206709, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but I''m not sure what''s up and what''s down.  Maybe my own perceptions are askew.  It kind of looks like a couple of porcupines walking across a stream.  I like the dark toning and the tendency towards abstraction.</td>', 'I like this picture, but I''m not sure what''s up and what''s down.  Maybe my own perceptions are askew.  It kind of looks like a couple of porcupines walking across a stream.  I like the dark toning and the tendency towards abstraction.', '2017-10-19 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539943, 1206451, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tableau, like a Chinese scroll, elliptical and mysterious.  The floating leaves, the diaphanous green foreground, the simple path --   it all comes together in remarkably accomplished fashion.  A poem of yearning, to my eye.</td>', 'Beautiful tableau, like a Chinese scroll, elliptical and mysterious.  The floating leaves, the diaphanous green foreground, the simple path --   it all comes together in remarkably accomplished fashion.  A poem of yearning, to my eye.', '2017-10-19 21:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539946, 1206527, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  The reflection on the left unfolds normally, then that clump of grass on the right drifts into the scene, perfectly unreflected, disrupting visual expectations and complacency.  I also like how the reflected sky on top is darker and more foreboding than the actual sky.  Playfully, enjoyably unsettling.</td>', 'Very interesting.  The reflection on the left unfolds normally, then that clump of grass on the right drifts into the scene, perfectly unreflected, disrupting visual expectations and complacency.  I also like how the reflected sky on top is darker and more foreboding than the actual sky.  Playfully, enjoyably unsettling.', '2017-10-19 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539947, 1206704, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever counter-flip that confuses the viewer (at least it confuses me).  I also like how the globe is framed by the fringe of the tree.  Nice.</td>', 'Clever counter-flip that confuses the viewer (at least it confuses me).  I also like how the globe is framed by the fringe of the tree.  Nice.', '2017-10-19 21:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539949, 1206687, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple, subtle and elegant.  Fine composition and distribution of tones.  A true water creature, shadowy, tenuous and ungraspable.  Beautifully seen and presented.  Most excellent.</td>', 'Simple, subtle and elegant.  Fine composition and distribution of tones.  A true water creature, shadowy, tenuous and ungraspable.  Beautifully seen and presented.  Most excellent.', '2017-10-19 21:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539950, 1206507, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely watery world.  A beautiful shade of green, muted yet not quite somber.  Gentle and contemplative.  Excellent image.  Nice title.</td>', 'Lovely watery world.  A beautiful shade of green, muted yet not quite somber.  Gentle and contemplative.  Excellent image.  Nice title.', '2017-10-19 22:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539952, 1206518, 173844, '<td valign="top">This inverted world is so much more portentous than ho-hum reality.  It''s almost dystopian with stuff flying through the air, people wandering aimlessly.  I want to see the movie.  Good stuff.</td>', 'This inverted world is so much more portentous than ho-hum reality.  It''s almost dystopian with stuff flying through the air, people wandering aimlessly.  I want to see the movie.  Good stuff.', '2017-10-19 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539954, 1206693, 173844, '<td valign="top">So much to see and appreciate here.  The entire scene seems supported by columns of legs and varied shoes.  The puddle that provides the canvas opens up on a surreal urban carnival, bright and expansive.  The roadway peeks through the water as stars-cum-confetti.  The central man in shorts strides across like a colossus.  It''s fun and enchanting.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'So much to see and appreciate here.  The entire scene seems supported by columns of legs and varied shoes.  The puddle that provides the canvas opens up on a surreal urban carnival, bright and expansive.  The roadway peeks through the water as stars-cum-confetti.  The central man in shorts strides across like a colossus.  It''s fun and enchanting.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-10-19 22:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539955, 1206710, 173844, '<td valign="top">A mesmerizing vision, exotic and moving.  The upside down flowers remind me of nothing more than jellyfish in a magical sea, silent and unaware of their own beauty.  I think I''d call it an artful disposition rather than composition.  Does that make any sense?  You''ve got the touch.</td>', 'A mesmerizing vision, exotic and moving.  The upside down flowers remind me of nothing more than jellyfish in a magical sea, silent and unaware of their own beauty.  I think I''d call it an artful disposition rather than composition.  Does that make any sense?  You''ve got the touch.', '2017-10-19 22:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539956, 1206682, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Just the perfect amount of shimmer in the water to attain an impressionistic seascape.  The vaguely pyramidal composition is quite pleasing.  The "sky" has been adroitly enhanced, but no more than in keeping with the playful toying with the up top original.  Impressive and entrancing.</td>', 'Great title.  Just the perfect amount of shimmer in the water to attain an impressionistic seascape.  The vaguely pyramidal composition is quite pleasing.  The "sky" has been adroitly enhanced, but no more than in keeping with the playful toying with the up top original.  Impressive and entrancing.', '2017-10-19 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539957, 1206553, 173844, '<td valign="top">This looks so good flipped over, and I never would have foreseen this had I seen it upright.  It seems to be a special ability to imagine such results before they''re performed, an ability I don''t have.  It''s like she''s holding a spaceship aloft, elegant as a swallow.  I love the composition and the color combination.  Beautifully ethereal.</td>', 'This looks so good flipped over, and I never would have foreseen this had I seen it upright.  It seems to be a special ability to imagine such results before they''re performed, an ability I don''t have.  It''s like she''s holding a spaceship aloft, elegant as a swallow.  I love the composition and the color combination.  Beautifully ethereal.', '2017-10-19 22:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539958, 1206673, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely interpretation of Escher''s architecture.  Gloriously intricate, textured and messy, it''s much meatier than Escher''s stylized jewels.  There''s even a ladder, and the detail is terrific.  Great light and shadow.<br/>Additionally clever is the title, "level", flippable as a palindrome.<br/>Fine image.</td>', 'Lovely interpretation of Escher''s architecture.  Gloriously intricate, textured and messy, it''s much meatier than Escher''s stylized jewels.  There''s even a ladder, and the detail is terrific.  Great light and shadow.Additionally clever is the title, "level", flippable as a palindrome.Fine image.', '2017-10-19 22:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539969, 1206687, 19825, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge. Nicely done.', '2017-10-19 23:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
