(7540036, 1206527, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>When I first opened this up before I read the challenge rules I thought, what the? It is of course, entirely appropriate for the challenge and also quite quirky as a result too. The exposure is good with good detail throughout, street pigeon has said it all...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well When I first opened this up before I read the challenge rules I thought, what the? It is of course, entirely appropriate for the challenge and also quite quirky as a result too. The exposure is good with good detail throughout, street pigeon has said it all...', '2017-10-20 06:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540038, 1206557, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Do they really stretch out upside down then? The image itself is up to your normal high standards Ronnie and no less amazing what you can do with your kit hand-held a credit to you. As far as the challenge is concerned there is not much else you could have done with but inevitably in terms of this challenge you were always going to be up against it so your score might not be as high as you wished for but nevertheless still respectable.<br/></td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Do they really stretch out upside down then? The image itself is up to your normal high standards Ronnie and no less amazing what you can do with your kit hand-held a credit to you. As far as the challenge is concerned there is not much else you could have done with but inevitably in terms of this challenge you were always going to be up against it so your score might not be as high as you wished for but nevertheless still respectable.', '2017-10-20 06:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
